# Internal dev docs — strategy / planning / research / specs. NOT published to the
# public GitHub repo. Operational + intro docs (INTRODUCTION, MCP-GUIDE, AGENT-TEMPLATE,
# API, ARCHITECTURE, HEALTH-METRICS, MEMORY-SYSTEM, PITCH-DECK, TESTING, LOCAL-DEV-SETUP,
# runbooks/, ROADMAP) stay public. These files still live in the working tree — back them
# up out-of-band (they are not in git). Add any new internal doc here.
SPEC.md
PROJECT-SPEC.md
docs/SPEC.md
docs/OVERVIEW.md
docs/TEST-PLAN.md
docs/BENCHMARK.md
docs/VALIDATION-*.md
docs/VISION.md
